# Dates: press d on a task and type a date the way you say it; no emoji to type.
Output assets/readme/feature-dates.gif
Source assets/readme/tapes/lib/common.tape

Type "2"
Sleep 1s
Down
Sleep 500ms
Down
Sleep 500ms
Type "d"
Sleep 1.2s
Type "+3d"
Sleep 1.2s
Tab
Sleep 500ms
Type "friday"
Sleep 1.8s
Enter
Sleep 1.5s
Type "W"
Sleep 2.5s
Type "W"
Sleep 800ms

Type "q"
